  "Description": "The Cato Networks solution pushes security and networking events from the Cato Management Application directly into Microsoft Sentinel using the Codeless Connector Framework (CCF) Push pattern. Events are delivered in near real time from the Cato Cloud into a custom Log Analytics table for hunting, analytics, and visualization. The solution also includes preview query-time ASIM source parsers for NetworkSession, Dns, WebSession, Authentication, AlertEvent, and AuditEvent.",
